<section class="about-first-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-first-main">
      <div class="about-first-left">
        <img
          width="629"
          height="369"
          class="w-full lazyload"
          src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0821/2738/8922/files/about-banner-thumb.jpg?v=1777535592"
          alt="Full width banner"
        >
      </div>
      <div class="about-first-right">
        <h1 class="thomasxlheading">Wear with Intent.</h1>
        <p>
         Premium menswear, designed for the way modern men actually live. Inclusive. Transparent. Built to last.
        </p>
        <p>
          Thomas Scott is an Indian menswear brand crafting smart casuals, shirts, t-shirts, and everyday essentials that balance quality, comfort, and contemporary style — at prices that respect your wardrobe and your wallet. Every piece is designed to be worn often, worn well, and worn with intent.

        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="about-second-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="top-heading top-btn-heading relative">
      <h2 class="thomasxlheading">All day. All seasons. All sizes.</h2>
      {% comment %} <p>
      A Modern Menswear Brand, Two Generations in the Making

      </p> {% endcomment %}
    </div>
    <div class="about-second-main">
      <picture class="picture">
        <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0821/2738/8922/files/about-second-banner-mobile.jpg?v=1777616901">
        <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0821/2738/8922/files/about-second-banner.jpg?v=1777536523">
        <img width="1320" height="417" class="w-full lazyload" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0821/2738/8922/files/about-second-banner.jpg?v=1777536523" alt="Full width banner">
      </picture>
      <div class="about-content-sec">
        <div class="thomasmdheading">A Modern Menswear Brand, Two Generations in the Making</div>
        <p>
         Thomas Scott began as a premium apparel label under industry veteran Brijgopal Bang, whose decades of manufacturing expertise shaped a reputation for craftsmanship and precision. Today, under the leadership of Vedant Bang, the brand has evolved into a digitally native menswear label built for the contemporary Indian consumer — one who values fit, fabric, and a point of view.

        </p>
        <p>
         Two generations. One standard. Premium menswear, made accessible.

        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="secret-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="top-heading top-btn-heading relative">
      <h3 class="thomasxlheading">What We Stand For
</h3>
      {% comment %} <p>
        At Thomas Scott, we don’t believe in keeping secrets. You will always know what you’re buying, where it comes
        from and how we make it. Manufacturing for two decades With some of the finest tailors & manufacturers in the
        industry, we come with a plethora of skills & expertise.
      </p> {% endcomment %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="secret-main-sec">
    <div class="">
      <div class="secret-slider">
        <div class="item">
          <div class="secret-card">
            <div class="secret-nub">01.</div>
            <div class="thomasmdheading">Designed for everyday wear.</div>
            <p>
             Our collections move with you — versatile enough for work, weekends, travel, and everything in between. Timeless essentials. Trend-forward edits. No filler.

            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="secret-card">
            <div class="secret-nub">02.</div>
            <div class="thomasmdheading">Crafted with experience.</div>
            <p>
             With over two decades in manufacturing, we work with some of the finest tailors and mills in India to refine every fit, fabric, and finish. Expertise you can feel in the seams.

            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="secret-card">
            <div class="secret-nub">03.</div>
            <div class="thomasmdheading">Built on transparency. </div>
            <p>
               You deserve to know what you're buying — and what went into making it. From fabric sourcing to final stitch, every step is documented, considered, and held to a single standard: no compromise on craftsmanship.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        {% comment %} <div class="item">
          <div class="secret-card">
            <div class="secret-nub">04.</div>
            <div class="thomasmdheading">SEDEX-certified manufacturer</div>
            <p>
              We comply with the standards laid down by the Universal Declaration of Human Rights, ILO Convention, and
              National Law.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div> {% endcomment %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="committed-sec">
    <picture class="picture">
        <source media="(max-width: 767px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0821/2738/8922/files/committed-banner-mobile.jpg?v=1777619564">
        <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0821/2738/8922/files/committed-banner.jpg?v=1777548528">
        <img width="1920" height="750" class="w-full lazyload" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0821/2738/8922/files/committed-banner.jpg?v=1777548528" alt="Full width banner">
    </picture>
    <div class="committed-content">
        <h4 class="thomasxlheading">The Thomas Scott Promise
</h4>
        <p>Every garment we make is held to four non-negotiables:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>Quality: Premium fabrics, sourced with care and tested for the long haul.</li>
 <li>Fit: Cuts designed for the modern Indian man, across every size. </li>
 <li>Comfort: Pieces you reach for first, not last. </li>
 <li>Durability: Clothing that earns its place in your rotation, season after season.</li>
</ul>

      </div>
</section>

<section class="fashion-sec">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="top-heading top-btn-heading relative">
      <h5 class="thomasxlheading">FASHION THAT CARES</h5>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="fashion-main-sec">
    <div class="">
      <div class="fashion-slider">
        <div class="item">
          <div class="secret-card">
            <div class="secret-nub">01.</div>
            <div class="thomasmdheading">SAFE ON YOUR SKIN</div>
            <p>Our fabrics are tested and certified to OEKO-TEX Standard 100, meaning every thread, button, and dye has been checked for over 1,000 harmful chemicals. What touches your skin all day should never be a question mark.
</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="secret-card">
            <div class="secret-nub">02.</div>
            <div class="thomasmdheading">COTTON YOU CAN TRUST</div>
            <p>We source through the Better Cotton Initiative, cotton grown with less water, fewer pesticides, and fairer wages for farmers. Softer hand-feel, lighter footprint, no compromise on quality.
</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="secret-card">
            <div class="secret-nub">03.</div>
            <div class="thomasmdheading">MADE BY PEOPLE TREATED RIGHT
</div>
            <p>Every garment is stitched in facilities audited by BSCI and Sedex, the global standards that protect fair wages, safe working conditions, and dignity for the 3,000+ skilled hands behind your wardrobe. The people who make your clothes matter as much as the people who wear them.
</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="secret-card">
            <div class="secret-nub">04.</div>
            <div class="thomasmdheading">NO MIDDLEMEN, NO MYSTERIES
</div>
            <p>From the cotton field to your doorstep, every step happens within our own network — fabric, stitching, finishing, dispatch. That means lower prices, faster delivery, and a straight answer to any question you ask about your garment.
</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
